{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49622","headline":"望远行 二 · 李珣","name":"望远行 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露滴幽庭落叶时，愁聚萧娘柳眉。\n玉郎一去负佳期，水云迢遰雁书迟。\n屏半掩，枕斜欹，蜡泪无言对垂。\n吟蛩断续漏频移，入窗明月鉴空帏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}